+   source-over of the two is v0's premultiplied color-mix exactly), its rounded corner is clip-path inset(0 round r)
+   (a shape mask on the composited layer: a radius change repaints nothing), and the menu card is laid out once at the
+   open size from v0's box origin (the clip cuts the overhang). Per frame only these follow v0's box: the backdrop's
+   height (the columns keep their width and their translateY(--col-offset) of the box height) and its centring (a
+   transform), the veil by a transform (scale to v0's box, JS --fw-bx-sx/sy), the card's zoom origin (v0's box centre),
+   and the centre block and the footer by layout. W and H are v0's formulas for the nav's width and height. */
